sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrainerOp as Trainer Operator<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant JobSetOpCR as JobSetOperator CR<br/>(operator.openshift.io)
    participant OLM as OLM API<br/>(operators.coreos.com)
    participant TrainerCtrl as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>Controller
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant JobSetCtrl as JobSet Controller

    Note over PlatformOp,JobSetCtrl: Flow 1: Trainer CR Reconciliation

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR 'default-trainer'<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: Watch event: Trainer CR created

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over TrainerOp,OLM: Dependency Validation (OpenShift)
        TrainerOp->>OLM: Verify JobSet Operator subscription<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        OLM-->>TrainerOp: Subscription exists
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Check JobSetOperator CR 'cluster'<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: CR exists
        TrainerOp->>JobSetOpCR: Check health conditions<br/>(Degraded, TargetConfigControllerDegraded,<br/>JobSetOperatorStaticResourcesDegraded)
        JobSetOpCR-->>TrainerOp: Not degraded
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Verify JobSet CRD established
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: CRD available
    end

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over TrainerOp,K8sAPI: Manifest Rendering & Apply
        TrainerOp->>TrainerOp: Load templates from /opt/manifests-template/
        TrainerOp->>TrainerOp: Render kustomize with RHOAI overlay<br/>+ RELATED_IMAGE_* param substitution
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Server-side apply: CRDs, Deployment,<br/>RBAC, Webhooks, ClusterTrainingRuntimes,<br/>ImageStreams, PodMonitor, NetworkPolicies<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: Resources applied
    end

    TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status conditions<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token

    Note over PlatformOp,JobSetCtrl: Flow 2: TrainJob Submission

    participant User as Data Scientist

    User->>K8sAPI: Create TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: User token (RBAC: training-edit)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate TrainJob<br/>Auth: API server mTLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission allowed
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created

    K8sAPI-->>TrainerCtrl: Watch event: TrainJob created
    TrainerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Resolve ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    TrainerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet<br/>(jobset.x-k8s.io/v1alpha2)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>JobSetCtrl: Watch event: JobSet created
    JobSetCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create training Pods<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>TrainerCtrl: JobSet status update
    TrainerCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update TrainJob status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
